// Eastern Carnival: elephant spectators (Batch 22)
@1 = ~Look at the size of that thing. I didn't even know of existance of such a creature.~
@2 = ~I want an elapant to be my animal. I love elapants!~
@3 = ~You look the type to be delving into mines, not a local fair.~
@4 = ~I've seen some kobolds near the tents recently. I really don't like kobolds.~
